#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:399
#: 9c8d314176454cd59bbdd96bdcfb86b0
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* or the nearest `Rally Point <common-rally-"
"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last armed"
" (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle configuration "
"allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__ （如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:410
#: 5928519087bf4779a1494a60ed1ecbd8
msgid "Return to the *home location* and HOLD (non-boat) or LOITER (boat)."
msgstr "返回*原点*并执行 Hold（非船）或 Loiter（船）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:412
#: d704b0c496314e6984fdf934956ace73
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission. Without using this command, end of mission behavior is set by "
"the :ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"此命令不带任何参数，通常应作为任务中的最后一条命令。如不使用此命令，任务结束行为由 "
":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` 参数设置。"

