msgid "Mission command to control a camera or antenna mount."
msgstr "用于控制相机或天线挂载的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1706
#: a09791e1e09649e98b8ea86b3a2d21b3
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a roll, pitch and yaw angle which will be"
" sent to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be "
"used to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the "
"mission."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1765
#: 0dba96b02e34482bb6a6fcb6f1d9656a
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_MOUNT_CONTROL command"
msgstr "DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1770
#: c7b414f2acbe4e97b6301212ba9ef41f
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1774
#: 33a6e20bb3b1495ba96eeb704eddef55
msgid ""
"Mission command to move the gimbal to the desired pitch and yaw angles (in "
"degrees)."
msgstr "将云台移动到期望俯仰和偏航角度（度）的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1776
#: cc971304718d48d7aef607333792e398
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a pitch and yaw angle which will be sent "
"to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can be used "
"to point the camera in specific directions at various times in the mission. "
"Positive pitch angles are up, Negative are down.  Positive yaw angles are "
"clockwise, negative are counter clockwise."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。俯仰角正值表示向上，负值表示向下。偏航角正值为顺时针，负值为逆时针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1835
#: 87faac2b5e3d4389950ab6d293db6bfa
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW command"
msgstr "DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1840
#: ff83bdf5b1d14a9d881b3ada9903da2e
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1844
#: a38588747a5b44e5b91b8ea662681e83
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` at "
"regular distance intervals. This command is useful in :ref:`camera survey "
"missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. To "
"trigger the camera once, immediately after passing the DO command, set "
"param3 to 1."
msgstr ""
"以固定距离间隔触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。此指令在 :ref:`相机航拍任务 "
"<common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>` 中很有用。如需在经过 DO "
"指令后立即触发相机一次，将 param3 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1850
#: 7a20a1b5a64d4e2b853d6a76744b9d30
msgid ""
"Providing a distance of zero will stop the camera shutter from being "
"triggered."
msgstr "将距离设为零将停止相机快门的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1905
#: 4778380094f64b67987b6e48a87f58d0
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST command"
msgstr "DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1907
#: cda6997f06ec40f78bc3d4fe787410d2
msgid ""
"The above configuration will cause the camera shutter to trigger after every"
" 5m that the vehicle travels."
msgstr "上述配置将使相机快门在飞行器每飞行 5m 后触发一次。"

