#~ "rally-points>` if closer) and then land. The home location is where the "
#~ "vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the "
#~ "vehicle configuration allows this)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "返回 *Home 位置*（或最近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，如果更近），然后降落。Home "
